    "explanation": "Conditional rule: revision-guarded mutations occur only when expect equals the current revision; successful rollback restores retained snapshot value but advances the current revision. Save/drop affect retention without changing revision.",
    "mapping": "config.initial -> value; state revision -> revision; retained IDs and immutable snapshots -> snapshots/saved; event.expect guards writes and rollbacks.",
